---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import MapView from "../components/MapView.astro";
---
<Base title="rooftop solar map · ghost-watts" pathname="/map">
  <section class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 pt-8 pb-4">
    <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-ink-500 mb-2 font-mono">rooftop solar · greater metro manila</p>
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl mb-3 leading-tight">Every rooftop solar install we could spot from space.</h1>
    <p class="text-ink-700 max-w-prose leading-relaxed">
      We taught an AI to spot solar panels in satellite photos, then pointed it at every neighborhood across NCR and the surrounding cities in Bulacan, Cavite, Rizal, and Laguna. It found <strong>617 rooftops with solar panels</strong>. About <strong>96% of the time it's right</strong>, and most of these rooftops aren't on any prior public map. Click any city to see how many. Zoom in and click any roof to see the panels for yourself.
    </p>
  </section>

  <MapView />

  <section class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-6 text-xs text-ink-500">
    These are AI findings, not official records. About 1 in 25 high-confidence picks may be wrong - treat the map as a starting point, not a permit list. Use freely with credit: ghost-watts (2026Q2), https://github.com/xmpuspus/ghost-watts. CC-BY-4.0 on data.
  </section>
</Base>
